description:
Blackpool Council ("Council") is seeking to procure a Development Partner, with the requisite skills and track record to work in partnership with the Council to redevelop a 5.41-hectare site close to Blackpool town centre to deliver a high quality residential-led scheme, including the following key worksteams:
•	demolish up to 300 densely populated properties and existing structures including the removal of associated infrastructure;
•	undertake site clearance and preparation work;
•	develop up

The appointed consultant will prepare a comprehensive Activity & Interpretation Plan which demonstrates how people will engage with St Peter's Church and the wider heritage of Thetford through:

•	Learning;
•	Volunteering;
•	Skills development;
•	Community engagement;
•	Interpretation;
•	Participation;
•	Events;
•	Training;
•	Outreach activities.

